<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="text-primary">About Gift of the Givers</h1>
    <p class="lead">We are a humanitarian organisation providing emergency assistance and disaster relief to communities affected by natural disasters and other crises.</p>
    <p>Founded on the principles of compassion and service, we mobilise resources, volunteers and expertise to reach those who need it most — when they need it most.</p>
    <h3 class="mt-4">Our Mission</h3>
    <p>To deliver effective, efficient and transparent humanitarian aid to vulnerable communities regardless of race, religion, or political affiliation.</p>
